# Royal Elementor Addons – Frontend JS

**Do not touch `assets/js/frontend.js` at all** (no edits, refactors, or sync changes).

- All frontend JavaScript work happens in **`assets/js/frontend.min.js`** only.
- If a task would normally require updating both files, **only change `frontend.min.js`** and leave `frontend.js` unchanged.
